<title>BELGIUM: Bank Paribas Luxembourg 1996 profit doubles.</title>
<headline>Bank Paribas Luxembourg 1996 profit doubles.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996 (in billions of Luxembourg francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit	 2.07  vs  1.05</p>
<p>    Total assets	   295.4  vs 273.8</p>
<p>NOTE - In a statement,  Bank Paribas Luxembourg said its results were lifted by capital gains on the sale of stakes in Banque Continentale du Luxembourg and  Cie Financiere Ottomane. (( -- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710 ))</p>
